data: {"content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_95549","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":165,"text":"Implemented the required UI and server functionality fixes:\n\n- Removed backticks inside JavaScript template literals that caused runtime syntax errors.\n- Updated comments to avoid backticks and clarified accessibility notes.\n- Fixed navigation URL generation to use string concatenation, preventing template literal conflicts.\n- Ensured alert role comment is clean and functional.\n\nAll changes are committed.\n\n**Commit ID:** `6686eef9adf726f2635295f0541d28d4a28533c5`\n\n**Run command:** `npm start` (binds to `0.0.0.0` on `PORT` (default 8080) and uses the SQLite file at `DB_PATH`).","type":"response.output_text.done"}

